## 🔄 Rollback Instructions

### Automatic Rollback

To restore all backed-up files automatically:

```bash
vacuum rollback {{ checkpoint_id }}
```

This will:
1. Verify checkpoint integrity
2. Restore all backed-up files to original locations
3. Verify restoration with hash validation
4. Generate restoration report

---

### Manual Rollback

If automatic rollback fails, manually restore files:

{% for category, files in backup.files_by_category.items() %}
#### {{ category }}

{% for file in files[:10] %}
```bash
# Restore {{ file.original_path }}
cp "{{ file.backup_path }}" "{{ file.original_path }}"
```
{% endfor %}

{% endfor %}

