## 🔐 Integrity Verification

**Checkpoint Hash:** `{{ checkpoint.hash }}`  
**Manifest Hash:** `{{ manifest.hash }}`

To verify checkpoint integrity:

```bash
vacuum verify-checkpoint {{ checkpoint_id }}
```

Expected output:
```
✅ Checkpoint integrity: VALID
✅ All {{ backup.file_count }} backups verified
✅ Hash validation: PASSED
```

