## ⏰ Expiration

**Expiration Date:** {{ expiration_date }}  
**Days Remaining:** {{ days_remaining }}

**⚠️ WARNING:** This checkpoint will be automatically deleted on {{ expiration_date }}.

To extend checkpoint retention:

```bash
vacuum extend-checkpoint {{ checkpoint_id }} --days 30
```

To make checkpoint permanent:

```bash
vacuum preserve-checkpoint {{ checkpoint_id }}
```

