## 🔧 Advanced Operations

### Partial Rollback

Restore specific files only:

```bash
vacuum rollback {{ checkpoint_id }} --files "{{ backup.files_by_category.temp_files[0].original_path }}"
```

### Rollback to Different Location

Restore to alternate directory:

```bash
vacuum rollback {{ checkpoint_id }} --target "/alternate/path"
```

### Dry-Run Rollback

Preview rollback without making changes:

```bash
vacuum rollback {{ checkpoint_id }} --dry-run
```

